      "comment": "ZIPPER STRIDE (7) was in the placings last time but shapes well for this on his powerful win the start prior, getting around this track over 400m in 22.31. Has the ability and looks a key chance again. CALYPSO ETHICS (8) last start finished 2nd on August 22 over 520m at Wentworth Park behind Cawbourne Ozzy beaten 5.5 lengths (30.10) in a Grade 5. Looks well placed here and among the chances. HELLO AERIAL (1) had been in super honest form hitting the frame two times on end before finishing fourth (25.38) at this track last time. Solid record here at the distance winning two races. Better than last start and can bounce back. SMART MINX (2) missed the placings here last start but is well-placed to make amends.",
